1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,300
Look up — the Milky Way is all around us

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,300
This light may have travelled for tens of thousands of years

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,800
The Sun sits on the Orion Arm of the galaxy

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,500
The galaxy is about 100,000 light-years across

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,500
We are not observers of it — we are one star in it
